#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:5
#: 6a7657e7f4e04db894cb89e305773624
msgid "Using DO_LAND_START"
msgstr "使用DO_LAND_START"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:7
#: bc2e161ce9bb4f599bf5ed0f0c903d62
msgid ""
"The :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` mission item can be used"
" for two purposes:"
msgstr ":ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` 任务项可用于两个目的："

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:9
#: 399bfe7f1e1643ecba74c453b897758b
msgid ""
"In Plane, to provide an automatic re-attempt for an aborted NAV_LAND "
"autolanding in a mission. (See :ref:`aborting-autolanding`)"
msgstr "在Plane中，为任务中中止的NAV_LAND自动着陆提供自动重试。（参见 :ref:`aborting-autolanding`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:10
#: e9438cbc76ed4f13a534bd7bef403826
msgid ""
"To provide an automatic landing sequence for RTLs in Plane or as a "
"failsafe action in Copter."
msgstr "为Plane的RTL提供自动着陆序列，或作为Copter的失控保护动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:12
#: 1e314be99cdc43588d100d21fed3a1f9
msgid ""
"in Rover, it can be used, but only via Scripting call to start the "
"landing sequence."
msgstr "在Rover中，可以使用，但仅通过脚本调用来启动着陆序列。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:17
#: ebb7cc1585964a96943201227ef9c50c
msgid ""
"You can optionally include more than one ``DO_LAND_START`` mission item "
"in your mission. If that is done then the latitude/longitude/altitude of "
"the ``DO_LAND_START`` mission items is used to choose which landing "
"sequence to use. The ``DO_LAND_START`` closest to the current location in"
" all three dimensions is used. This can be useful if you have multiple "
"landing sequences for different wind conditions or different areas."
msgstr ""
"您可以在任务中选择性地包含多个 ``DO_LAND_START`` 任务项。若如此设置，则使用 ``DO_LAND_START`` "
"任务项的纬度/经度/高度来选择使用哪个着陆序列。选取在三维空间中距当前位置最近的 "
"``DO_LAND_START``。这在针对不同风向条件或不同区域设置多个着陆序列时非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-do-land-start.rst:19
#: 73825d563ced4b328c49d1a7cf6fd351
msgid ""
"If you are already in a landing sequence (NAV_LAND or DO_START_LAND "
"sequence), then it will continue."
msgstr "若已在着陆序列（NAV_LAND或DO_START_LAND序列）中，则将继续执行。"

#~ msgid "To use, you need to do two things:"
#~ msgstr "使用时需执行两步："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "add a :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>`"
#~ " mission item to your mission, just"
#~ " before the start of your landing "
#~ "sequence(s)."
#~ msgstr "在任务中添加一个 :ref:`DO_LAND_START <mav_cmd_do_land_start>` 任务项，位于着陆序列开始之前。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "use ``DO_LAND_START`` as a failsafe "
#~ "action. For example, setting "
#~ ":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` = \"6\" for "
#~ "RC failsafe."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "将 ``DO_LAND_START`` 用作失控保护动作。例如，将 "
#~ ":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 设置为「6」用于RC失控保护。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "the \"landing sequence\" whose start is"
#~ " the ``DO_LAND_START`` marker, does not "
#~ "actually have to include a landing! "
#~ "it can be any sequence of valid"
#~ " mission commands."
#~ msgstr "以 ``DO_LAND_START`` 标记为起点的「着陆序列」实际上不必包含着陆动作！它可以是任何有效任务命令的序列。"

